-- SOURCE-LIKE rendering — the signature spells the transparent alias
-- `Age` — and when the normalized form differs it MUST be exposed
-- (normalizedExpected). Eagerly unfolding the alias into `expected` and
-- omitting the normalized/alias distinction loses both MUST fields.
